                        "difficultyIds": "80db17ea97ed8fdcd1b6b9666390fca1",
                        "difficulty": "考试范围-Applying 应用",
                        "textAnalysis": "Rationale:\nThe client with hypoparathyroidism is instructed to follow a calcium-rich diet and to restrict the amount of phosphorus in the diet. Vegetables are allowed in the diet. The client needs to limit meat, poultry, fish, eggs, cheese, and cereals.\n\nTest-Taking Strategy:\nFocus on the subject, hypoparathyroidism, and the client's diagnosis. Think about the pathophysiology associated with this disorder. Recalling that the client would restrict the amount of phosphorus in the diet and increase calcium intake and recalling the nutritional value of foods will direct you to the correct option.",
